From: FakeMichau <49685661+FakeMichau@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Make CFG sort ordering independent of the C++ standard library

Use the libstdc++ introsort ordering throughout cfg_structurizer.cpp so MSVC
and libc++ builds reproduce the reference SPIR-V. Preserve stable_sort calls.

